Inspected release sources: Debian 13 (trixie), openssh 1:10.0p1-7;
Ubuntu 24.04 LTS (noble), openssh 1:9.6p1-3ubuntu13, pam 1.5.3-5ubuntu5.
These are inspected release snapshots, not claims about latest security updates.

